  (text "The breakout socket, pull-ups and PMODs follow the Tiny Tapeout demo board v3 exactly.\nLogic-analyzer header for this design: ui_in[0..3] = SCLK, CS_N, MOSI, BYPASS;\nuo_out[0..3] = MISO, DONE, SKIP, BUSY; uo_out[4..7] = TAP[0..3].\nAnalog pins: 10 Mohm pull-downs only, as on the demo board. RES pins left open."
    (at 25.4 382 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "66abd7f9-771d-54ff-a494-5a5f571d44b6")
  )
